<title>USA: BTG Inc awarded $10 mln, 1-year contract.</title>
<headline>BTG Inc awarded $10 mln, 1-year contract.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA, Va. 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>BTG Inc said Friday it has been awarded a $10 million, one-year contract by the Tennessee Valley Authority to provide its facilities with computers, hardware, software and support services.</p>
<p>The contract has an option of two additional years carrying an equal or greater value.  The company said the potential contract capacity was more than $30 million.</p>
</text>
